H. K. D. H. Bhadeshia, Cambridge/Queen Mary author-associated teaching collection. [Named courses, notes, question sheets, worked answers, and graduate studies](https://www.phase-trans.msm.cam.ac.uk/teaching.html).

Work the complete year-2 Metals & Alloys progression and question sheets, then year-3 material on alloy families, transformations, strengthening, and welding. For advanced study, complete the published master-level steels notes/examples and the relevant Materials Modelling/MPhil thermodynamics, phase-diagram, crystallography, and method work. Select actual named source documents, preserving their revisions.

The course levels, topic layout, answer/experiment links, and division between free and restricted books were verified on 29 October 2026. Public author-hosted reading is not assumed to put every image, book, video, or program under one licence. The separate Phase Transitions book explicitly declares CC BY 4.0; do not transfer that licence to other works. All source material remains external.

